templates.content:
PROTOCOL: {PROTOCOL_NAME}
Chain: {CHAIN}
Pool: {POOL_PAIR}
Entry Date: {ENTRY_DATE}

DUE DILIGENCE:
[ ] Protocol age: {PROTOCOL_AGE} (min 2 weeks)
[ ] Audit: {AUDIT_STATUS} by {AUDITOR}
[ ] Fee APY: {FEE_APY}% | Incentive APY: {INCENTIVE_APY}%
[ ] TVL: ${TVL} | 30-day trend: {TVL_TREND}
[ ] Team allocation: {TEAM_PCT}% | Vest: {VEST_PERIOD}
[ ] IL break-even: {IL_BREAKEVEN}x price move
[ ] Gas cost annual: {GAS_ANNUAL_PCT}% of projected yield

EXIT TRIGGERS (define before entering):
Profit target: {PROFIT_TARGET}%
Loss limit: {LOSS_LIMIT}%
Protocol health trigger: TVL drop >{TVL_DROP_THRESHOLD}% in 48h
Opportunity cost trigger: {OPP_COST_TRIGGER}

POSITION SIZE: ${POSITION_SIZE} ({PORTFOLIO_PCT}% of portfolio)
Risk tier: {RISK_TIER} (1=high trust, 2=medium, 3=new/unproven)
